// Eraser diagram type: Flow Chart
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

User picks CSV [shape: oval, icon: user]
Stream body to disk [icon: upload-cloud]
Hash sha256 and count lines while streaming [icon: hash]
Size over cap [shape: diamond, icon: alert-triangle]
Reject with 413 [shape: oval, icon: x-circle, color: red]
Same campaign and hash exists [shape: diamond, icon: copy]
Return existing import_id [shape: oval, icon: corner-up-left, color: gray]
Create import with status uploaded [icon: database]
Return 202 with import_id [shape: oval, icon: check, color: green]

Preview [icon: eye, color: blue] {
  Read first 50 rows only [icon: file-text]
  Header name match [icon: type]
  Valid sample share [icon: percent]
  Column score [icon: bar-chart-2]
  Suggest phone order and name [icon: star]
}

Mapping [icon: sliders, color: purple] {
  User sets phone priority list [icon: list]
  User picks name column [icon: user-check]
  User picks vars to keep [icon: tag]
  User sets region and landline rule [icon: globe]
}

Set status queued and enqueue [shape: oval, icon: send, color: orange]

User picks CSV > Stream body to disk
Stream body to disk > Hash sha256 and count lines while streaming
Hash sha256 and count lines while streaming > Size over cap
Size over cap > Reject with 413: yes
Size over cap > Same campaign and hash exists: no
Same campaign and hash exists > Return existing import_id: yes
Same campaign and hash exists > Create import with status uploaded: no
Create import with status uploaded > Return 202 with import_id
Return 202 with import_id > Read first 50 rows only
Read first 50 rows only > Header name match
Read first 50 rows only > Valid sample share
Header name match > Column score: weight 0.4
Valid sample share > Column score: weight 0.6
Column score > Suggest phone order and name
Suggest phone order and name > User sets phone priority list
User sets phone priority list > User picks name column
User picks name column > User picks vars to keep
User picks vars to keep > User sets region and landline rule
User sets region and landline rule > Set status queued and enqueue
